<title>NORWAY: Kvaerner wins 170 mln NOK contract.</title>
<headline>Kvaerner wins 170 mln NOK contract.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kvaerner Kleven Leirvik A.S, a subsidiary of Norwegian industrial group Kvaerner ASA, will build an offshore industry vessel for District Offshore A.S company, Oslo Bourse said in Friday.</p>
<p>The contract is worth 170 million crowns, it said.</p>
<p>Kvaerner Kleven's order backlog consists of six ships with a total value of 1.3 billion crowns.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
